Description:It is your second main phase. You are at 1 life and control Phyrexian Unlife. You have Earthquake in hand with four red mana floating. The opponent is at 3 life and controls no permanents. Win the game this turn.
Rule:authored-cant-lose-simultaneous | Earthquake deals its damage to each player at once and both players reach 0 or less together (CR 120.3, 704.5a), which would be a draw (CR 104.4a); Phyrexian Unlife says you don't lose for having 0 or less life (CR 104.3b, 614 replacement), so only the opponent loses: cast it with X = 3; a smaller X leaves the opponent alive
